        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-ink mb-6">What therapy offers at this stage</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-8">Emerging adulthood is the period with the most options and the least clarity. Our aim is not to decide for you, but to make visible the values, fears and expectations underneath the decision. If you are a university student, our <a href="/en/services/student-counselling.html" class="text-primary hover:underline">student counselling</a> page may also be relevant.</p>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
