            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-2">Direction and Decisions</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">We clarify the values beneath "I don't know what I want" and unpick the loop that keeps postponing the decision.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-tertiary">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-2">Setting Boundaries</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">Building autonomy without severing family ties: saying no, and managing the guilt that follows.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-tertiary">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-2">Attachment and Relationships</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">We look at recurring relationship patterns and how your attachment style shapes today's choices.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-tertiary">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-2">Managing Anxiety</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">Workable skills for future-focused worry, comparison and the feeling of falling behind.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

