        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-ink mb-6">If I am a student, which service suits me?</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">If you are currently at university and the subject is directly about student life — exam anxiety, adjusting to the island, workload — <a href="/en/services/student-counselling.html" class="text-primary underline hover:no-underline">student counselling</a> may suit better.</p>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">If the subject is broader than studying — identity, relationships or direction — the work described on this page fits better. If you are unsure we decide together in the first meeting, and moving between the two is possible.</p>
